@BackendApp_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

GET {{BackendApp_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

### Get All
GET {{BackendApp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products
Accept: application/json


### Get Product by ProductCode
GET {{BackendApp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products/PR-001
Accept: application/json

### Practice Product not Found
GET {{BackendApp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products/P0100
Accept: application/json

### Create Product
POST {{BackendApp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json 

# {
#     "productCode": "P002", 
#     "name": "Jaket Hoodie Polos",
#     "price": 250000, 
#     "stock": 60, 
#     "category": "Outerwear"
# }

{

    "productCode": "P003", 
    "name": "Kemeja Flanel Kotak",
    "price": 220000, 
    "stock": 75, 
    "category": "Atasan"
}


### Delete Product
DELETE  {{BackendApp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products/PR-001
Accept: application/json

### Update
PUT {{BackendApp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products/PR-001
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json 

{
    "name": "Kaos Polos Cotton Combed",
    "price": 75000, 
    "stock": 150, 
    "category": "Atasan"
}



### Upload Gambar
POST {{{{BackendApp_HostAddress}}}}/api/v1/products/P003/image
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=KodaStore

--KodaStore
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="valid_product.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< E:\Upload\valid_product.jpg

